{"id":"n40651-1-7","stage":4,"title":"꼬박 · 整整","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40651-1-7-1","ko":"눈이 빨갛게 충혈됐네.","zh":"你的眼睛都红充血了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"눈이","meaning":"雪","explanation":"눈：雪；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20198","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빨갛게","meaning":"红","explanation":"빨갛다：红；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"빨갛다","audio":"/audio/6edc039e433d1613937c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71070","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨갛다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"충혈됐네.","meaning":"充血，淤血","explanation":"충혈되다：充血，淤血；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"충혈되다","audio":"/audio/2535115dcc6a04ea00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78875","senseId":"1","lemma":"충혈되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ab1b14816087979d","term":"눈","zh":"雪","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3","entryId":"20198","definition":"空气中的水气结冰后掉到地面后形成的白色棉花状小冰块。","pronunciation":["눈ː"]},{"id":"6edc039e433d1613","term":"빨갛다","zh":"红","audio":"/audio/6edc039e433d1613937c.mp3","entryId":"71070","definition":"如同鲜血或熟透的辣椒一样鲜明而浓艳地发红。","pronunciation":["빨ː가타"]},{"id":"2535115dcc6a04ea","term":"충혈되다","zh":"充血，淤血","audio":"/audio/2535115dcc6a04ea00ef.mp3","entryId":"78875","definition":"血液聚集在身体的某一部位而使该部位的皮肤或血管显得通红。","pronunciation":["충혈되다","충혈뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/47d616e60e15b34bb088.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40651-1-7-2","ko":"응, 시험공부를 하느라 밤을 꼬박 샜거든.","zh":"嗯，因为要备考考试，一整晚都没睡觉呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시험공부를","meaning":"备考，考试复习","explanation":"시험공부：备考，考试复习；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"시험공부","audio":"/audio/c914b5145dc029ff3787.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65757","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험공부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하느라","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；느라：说明因忙于前一动作而出现后续情况，常接不利结果。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밤을","meaning":"夜，夜间","explanation":"밤：夜，夜间；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"밤","audio":"/audio/da9e530428ce1c2deaf3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74178","senseId":"1","lemma":"밤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꼬박","meaning":"整整","explanation":"꼬박：整整","readings":[{"term":"꼬박","audio":"/audio/2d3a0d90f021944d986c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40651","senseId":"1","lemma":"꼬박","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"샜거든.","meaning":"天亮，破晓","explanation":"새다：天亮，破晓；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"새다","audio":"/audio/d152606bd862b7092fd5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84608","senseId":"1","lemma":"새다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"c914b5145dc029ff","term":"시험공부","zh":"备考，考试复习","audio":"/audio/c914b5145dc029ff3787.mp3","entryId":"65757","definition":"为了考好考试而学习。","pronunciation":["시험공부"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"da9e530428ce1c2d","term":"밤","zh":"夜，夜间","audio":"/audio/da9e530428ce1c2deaf3.mp3","entryId":"74178","definition":"日落到第二天日出前的黑暗时段。","pronunciation":["밤"]},{"id":"2d3a0d90f021944d","term":"꼬박","zh":"整整","audio":"/audio/2d3a0d90f021944d986c.mp3","entryId":"40651","definition":"把做某事所需要的整个时间全都用上。","pronunciation":["꼬박"]},{"id":"d152606bd862b709","term":"새다","zh":"天亮，破晓","audio":"/audio/d152606bd862b7092fd5.mp3","entryId":"84608","definition":"渐渐天明。","pronunciation":["새ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/bf40f41a5414f1a215ac.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.12,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=40651","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":148,"sequenceScore":2.9467,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，因为要备考考试，一整晚都没睡觉呢。","你的眼睛都红充血了啊。","伤口怎么恶化成这样了？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你的眼睛都红充血了啊。","伤口怎么恶化成这样了？","嗯，因为要备考考试，一整晚都没睡觉呢。"],"answer":2}]}
